*  countdown.sno -- count from ten down to zero.
*  Part of github.com/mdhender/sil. BSD 2-Clause; see LICENSE.
*
*  A loop and a comparison, which is the smallest thing that runs the
*  interpreter's goto field round more than once.
        N = 10
LOOP    OUTPUT = N
        N = N - 1
        GE(N,0)                        :S(LOOP)
END
